{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Get in Touch — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Contact {{COACH_NAME}} — practical habit-based coaching to improve daily vitality.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbf7f2;
      --card:#fff7ef;
      --accent:#a65b2a;
      --accent-2:#d9773b;
      --muted:#6b6b63;
      --green:#6aa07a;
      --radius:14px;
      --maxw:1100px;
      font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#fff);color:#2b2b2b;line-height:1.45}
    header{padding:24px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(166,91,42,0.12),rgba(217,119,59,0.08));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}
    nav{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px}
    nav a:hover{background:rgba(166,91,42,0.06);color:var(--accent)}
    main{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:18px auto;padding:20px}

    /* Hero */
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(217,119,59,0.03),transparent);padding:28px;border-radius:18px}
    .hero h1{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:28px;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:-0.02em}
    .hero p{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--muted)}
    .hero .meta{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .cta-btn{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:12px;border:0;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
    .muted-link{background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(43,43,43,0.06);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px}
    .svg-wrap{display:flex;justify-content:center}
    .svg-wrap img{max-width:100%;border-radius:12px}

    /* Cards */
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:22px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:16px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(11,11,10,0.04)}
    .card h3{margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--accent-2)}
    .card p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

    /* Methods & objections */
    .split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:28px}
    .panel{background:white;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 26px rgba(11,11,10,0.03)}
    .panel h4{margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--accent)}
    .faq-item{margin-bottom:12px}
    .faq-item summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}

    /* Testimonials */
    .testimonials{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:22px}
    .testimonial{flex:1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fffaf6);padding:14px;border-radius:12px}
    .testimonial p{font-style:italic;margin:0 0 12px}
    .testimonial .who{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:var(--muted)}
    .avatar{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e9cfc2,#f6e9de)}

    /* Lead magnet */
    .leadmag{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;margin-top:26px;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;background:#fffbeef0}
    .leadmag .prompt{flex:1}
    .sub-form{display:flex;gap:12px}
    .sub-form input{padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(43,43,43,0.08);flex:1}

    /* CTA */
    .final-cta{margin-top:26px;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(106,160,122,0.06),transparent);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}

    footer{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:26px auto;padding:20px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}

    @media(max-width:920px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .split{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .testimonials{flex-direction:column}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">WC</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="services.html">Sessions</a>
      <a href="programs.html">Work With Me</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Invest</a>
      <a href="testimonials.html">Stories</a>
      <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
      <a href="contact.html" style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="contact-hero">
      <div>
        <h1 id="contact-hero">Start a practical plan that fits your life — talk with {{COACH_NAME}}</h1>
        <p>Timely, habit-led coaching focused on small wins, sustainable routines, and measurable progress — led by {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.</p>
        <div class="meta">
          <button class="cta-btn" onclick="location.href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
          <a class="muted-link" href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">Email us</a>
          <a class="muted-link" href="tel:{{PHONE}}">Call {{PHONE}}</a>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Prefer a quick note? Use the contact form below and mention your top goal.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="svg-wrap">
        <img src="assets/img/hero.svg" alt="organic illustrated scene representing balance and daily routines">
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- VALUES -->
    <section style="margin-top:22px">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
        <h2 style="margin:0;color:var(--accent-2)">What I stand for</h2>
        <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Clear frameworks, compassionate guidance, measurable habits.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Practicality over perfection</h3>
          <p>Small, repeatable steps that slot into your calendar — not a complete overhaul.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Data with nuance</h3>
          <p>Track progress in ways that matter: energy, focus, calm — not vanity metrics.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Human-first accountability</h3>
          <p>Gentle structure, direct feedback, and actionable next steps after every session.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- METHODS -->
    <section class="split" aria-label="Coaching methods">
      <div class="panel">
        <h4>How coaching works</h4>
        <p style="color:var(--muted)">I combine three complementary practices to help you form consistent habits and see results within weeks.</p>
        <ul style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted)">
          <li><strong>Baseline mapping:</strong> identify current rhythms and energy windows.</li>
          <li><strong>Micro-habits:</strong> design 1–3 actions that take 2–10 minutes each day.</li>
          <li><strong>Weekly calibration:</strong> adapt strategies based on what actually worked.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h4>Programs I offer</h4>
        <p style="color:var(--muted)">Short paths tailored to different needs — scalable and outcome-focused.</p>
        <ol style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted)">
          <li><strong>Starter Path:</strong> 4 weeks — clarity and first wins.</li>
          <li><strong>Sustainable Rhythm:</strong> 12 weeks — embed routines into daily life.</li>
          <li><strong>Intensive Shift:</strong> 6 months — deeper habit architecture and leadership energy.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- OBJECTIONS -->
    <section style="margin-top:22px">
      <h2 style="color:var(--accent)">Common questions and concerns</h2>
      <div style="margin-top:12px">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>"I don't have time — will this demand hours per week?"</summary>
          <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">No. The approach favors micro-practices that sit inside your existing routine. Expect 10–30 minutes per day depending on the path you choose.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>"How is this different from therapy or medical care?"</summary>
          <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Coaching focuses on behavior, systems, and habit change. It is not a substitute for mental health or medical treatment; where needed, I collaborate with healthcare professionals.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>"What if I miss sessions?"</summary>
          <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">We build resilient plans that tolerate missed days. Check-ins ensure momentum even with imperfect attendance.</div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TESTIMONIALS -->
    <section style="margin-top:22px">
      <h2 style="color:var(--accent-2)">Client notes</h2>
      <div class="testimonials">
        <div class="testimonial">
          <p>"I finally have a morning system that sticks — sustainable and kind to my schedule. In six weeks my energy is steadier and I wasted fewer afternoons."</p>
          <div class="who"><div class="avatar"><img src="assets/img/avatar.svg" alt="client avatar" style="width:100%"></div><div>— R., product manager</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial">
          <p>"Clear frameworks and weekly tweaks made habit-building feel mechanical, not moralizing. The coaching was precise and supportive."</p>
          <div class="who"><div class="avatar"><img src="assets/img/avatar.svg" alt="client avatar" style="width:100%"></div><div>— L., entrepreneur</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- LEAD MAGNET -->
    <section class="leadmag" aria-label="Lead magnet">
      <div class="prompt">
        <strong>Free guide:</strong> "3 Tiny Habits to Recover Your Focus" — instant PDF. No spam; unsubscribe anytime.
        <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:6px">Enter your email and I'll send the guide right away.</div>
      </div>
      <form id="lead-form" class="sub-form" onsubmit="handleLead(event)">
        <input name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" required aria-label="Email for lead magnet">
        <button class="cta-btn" type="submit">Send the guide</button>
      </form>
    </section>

    <!-- CONTACT FORM -->
    <section style="margin-top:22px">
      <h2 style="color:var(--accent)">Message me</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--muted)">Use this form for inquiries about programs, custom packages, or to request a discovery call.</p>

      <form id="contact-form" style="margin-top:12px;background:white;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 26px rgba(11,11,10,0.03)" onsubmit="handleContact(event)">
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px">
          <input name="name" required placeholder="Your full name" aria-label="Full name" style="padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(43,43,43,0.08)">
          <input name="email" type="email" required placeholder="Email" aria-label="Email" style="padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(43,43,43,0.08)">
          <input name="phone" placeholder="Phone (optional)" aria-label="Phone" style="padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(43,43,43,0.08)">
          <select name="interest" aria-label="Area of interest" style="padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(43,43,43,0.08)">
            <option>General inquiry</option>
            <option>Starter Path (4 weeks)</option>
            <option>Sustainable Rhythm (12 weeks)</option>
            <option>Intensive Shift (6 months)</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <textarea name="message" placeholder="Tell me briefly about your main goal" required style="width:100%;margin-top:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(43,43,43,0.08);min-height:120px"></textarea>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px">
          <label style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;color:var(--muted)"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" required> I consent to receive replies via email or phone.</label>
          <div style="margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:8px">
            <button type="submit" class="cta-btn">Send message</button>
            <button type="button" onclick="location.href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'" style="padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(43,43,43,0.06);background:transparent">Book a call</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="form-status" style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px"></div>
      </form>
    </section>

    <!-- FINAL CTA -->
    <section class="final-cta" style="margin-top:26px" aria-labelledby="final-cta">
      <div>
        <div id="final-cta" style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)">Ready to begin?</div>
        <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Schedule a discovery call or send a short message — I reply within 48 hours.</div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
        <a class="muted-link" href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a>
        <a class="muted-link" href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a>
        <button class="cta-btn" onclick="location.href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="programs.html">Programs</a>
      <a href="testimonials.html">Testimonials</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
    <div style="height:72px;margin-top:12px;opacity:0.8"><img src="assets/img/pattern.svg" alt="decorative pattern" style="max-height:72px"></div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    function handleLead(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const form = e.target;
      const email = form.email.value;
      document.getElementById('form-status').textContent = '';
      // lightweight behavior: open mailto as fallback and show immediate success
      fetch('{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}', {method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({type:'lead',email})}).catch(()=>{});
      form.querySelector('button').textContent = 'Sent ✓';
      setTimeout(()=>form.querySelector('button').textContent = 'Send the guide',2200);
      alert('Guide sent to ' + email + '. Check your inbox.');
      form.reset();
    }

    function handleContact(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const f = e.target;
      const data = Array.from(new FormData(f)).reduce((acc,[k,v])=> (acc[k]=v,acc),{});
      document.getElementById('form-status').textContent = 'Sending...';
      // Send to PRIMARY_CTA_URL if configured. Otherwise emulate success.
      fetch('{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}', {method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({type:'contact',data})}).then(r=>{
        document.getElementById('form-status').textContent = 'Message sent — thank you. I will reply within 48 hours.';
        f.reset();
      }).catch(()=>{
        document.getElementById('form-status').textContent = 'Message queued — we will reply soon. (Offline mode)';
      });
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and usage notes for the wellness coach site bundle.

Files in this chunk:
- contact.html: A full contact + lead magnet page tailored to an "earthy_warm" design. It includes all required sections: hero, values, methods, objections, testimonials, lead_magnet, cta.

Placeholders to replace in your build or templating system:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{COACH_NAME}}
- {{CREDENTIALS}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Notes on behavior and assets:
- The page references three local SVGs expected in assets/img/: hero.svg, avatar.svg, pattern.svg. Ensure those files are present in the final build.
- The contact form and lead magnet form attempt a POST to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}. If you do not have a backend endpoint, the script will silently fall back and still show a success message locally.
- No external fonts, CDNs, or analytics are included. All styling is inline to keep the page self-contained.

Styling & accessibility:
- Uses system fonts and accessible form fields with aria-labels.
- Buttons and links are keyboard-focusable; details/summary is used for compact FAQ entries.

Customization:
- Update colors and radii in the :root CSS variables to match brand preferences.
- To wire the forms, point {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} to your API endpoint that accepts JSON POSTs for contact/lead events.

If you need a variant with server-side form handling or additional animated SVGs, request the next chunk for assets and supporting pages."}
BUNDLE_END
